. Y. Jiang*, B. Zhou, Adaptive dynamic programming for unknown continuous-time nonlinear systems via bias-policy iteration, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 185 (2026) 112821.<br></p></li>            <li><p>Y. Ding, B. Zhou*, K.-K. Zhang, Prescribed-time control of the nonholonomic integrator with input-delay by periodic delayed feedback, <em style=\"\"><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 183 (2026) 112649.</p></li>            <li><p>L. Zhao, Z.-Y. Li*, B. Zhou, W. Michiels, On the normal form of linear time-delay systems with application to output feedback stabilization, <em style=\"\"><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 183 (2026) 112678.</p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, Stabilization of feedforward nonlinear time-delay systems with vanishing actuator effectiveness by linear time-varying feedback, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 183 (2026) 112635.</p></li>            <li><p>K.-K. Zhang, W. Michiels*, B. Zhou, Smooth memoryless time-varying control of a class of chained nonholonomic systems with input delays, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 187 (2026) 112890.<br></p></li>            <li><p>K.-K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, C.-C. Fan, J. Lam, Global prescribed-time control of a class of uncertain nonholonomic systems by smooth time-varying feedback, <em style=\"\"><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 181 (2025) 112503.<br></p></li>            <li><p>S.-L. Li, B. Zhou*, G.-R. Duan, K. Zhang, Prescribed-time semi-global output feedback stabilization by a time-varying high-gain observer, <em style=\"\"><strong>Automatica</strong></em>,179 (2025) 112454.<br></p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, Fully distributed and attack-immune protocols for linear multi-agent systems by linear time-varying feedback, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 172 (2025) 112009.<br></p></li>            <li><p>Z.-Y. Li*, Y.-X. Song, X. Li, B. Zhou, On stability analysis of stochastic neutral-type systems with multiple delays, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 171 (2025) 111905.<br></p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, Z.-Y. Li*, B. Zhou, Fully distributed output regulation of linear discrete-time multiagent systems with time-varying topology and delays, <strong><em>Automatica</em></strong>, 167 (2024) 111755.<br></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\">B. Zhou*, H.-Y. Jiang, On the invariant factors and the minimal polynomial assignments of linear systems, <em style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\"><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 164 (2024) 111632.</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\">K.-K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, G.-R. Duan, Global prescribed-time output feedback control of a class of uncertain nonlinear systems by linear time-varying feedback, <em style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\"><strong>Automatica</strong></em><span style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\">, 165 (2024) 111680.</span></span></p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou*, Z. Zhang, W. Michiels, Functional and dual observer based prescribed time control of linear systems by periodic delayed feedback, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 159 (2024) 111406.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou*, K.-K. Zhang, H.-Y. Jiang, Prescribed-time control of perturbed nonholonomic systems by time-varying feedback, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 155 (2023) 111125.</p></li>            <li><p>H.-Y. Jiang, B. Zhou*, Bias-policy iteration based adaptive dynamic programming for unknown continuous-time linear systems, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em> (<strong>Regular Paper</strong>), 136 (2022) 110058.</p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, G. R. Chen, Fully distributed and cyber-attack-immune cooperative output regulation by linear time-varying protocols, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control</strong></em> (full paper), 71 (2026) 3910-3925.<br></p></li>            <li><p>K.-K. Zhang*, B. Zhou, J. Lam, Global control of chained nonholonomic systems with input delays by finite-dimensional time-varying feedback, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control</strong></em>, 71 (2026) 2786-2793.<br></p></li>            <li><p>Y. Ding, B. Zhou*, Y. Shi, Prescribed-time control via periodic delayed feedback based super-twisting sliding mode algorithm, <em style=\"\"><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control </strong></em>(Full Paper), 71 (2026) 1813-1828.</p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, G.-R. Duan, Global consensus of double-integrator multi-agent systems with input saturation by fully distributed event-triggered and self-triggered controls, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control</strong></em>, 69 (2024) , 6269-6276.</p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, M.-Z. Hou, G.-R. Duan, Practical prescribed-time stabilization of a class of nonlinear systems by event-triggered and self-triggered control, <em style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\"><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control</strong></em>, 69 (2024) <span style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\">, 3426-3433</span>.</p></li>            <li><p>Y. Ding, B. Zhou*, K.-K. Zhang, W. Michiels, Strong prescribed-time stabilization of uncertain nonlinear systems by periodic delayed feedback, <em style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\"><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control</strong></em>, 69 (2024) 4072-4079.</p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, G. Wen, Global leader-following consensus of double-integrator multi-agent systems by fully distributed bounded linear protocols, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control</strong></em>, 67 (2022) 4846-4853.<br></p></li>            <li><p>Y.-X. Song, W. Michiels, B. Zhou*, G.-R. Duan, Strong stability analysis of linear delay difference equations with multiple time delays, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control</strong></em>, 66 (2021) 3741-3748.</p></li>            <li><p>X.-F. Yang, B. Zhou*, F. Mazenc, J. Lam, Global stabilization of discrete-time linear systems subject to input saturation and time delay, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control</strong></em>, 66 (2021) 1345-1352.</p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, J. H. Peng, B. Zhou*, Semi-global consensus of multi-agent systems by fully distributed energy-constrained linear protocols, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Control of Network Systems</strong></em>, DOI: 10.1109/TCNS.2026.3718823.</p></li>            <li><p>Y. Ding B. Zhou*, B. Li, Exactly prescribed-time attitude stabilizing and tracking control of underactuated axisymmetric spacecraft by time-varying delayed feedback，<em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Aerospace and Electronic Systems</strong></em>, to appear.<br></p></li>            <li><p>H. Y. Zheng, B. Zhou*, F. Zhang, Two-stage impact time control guidance with limited field of view based on periodic delayed feedback, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Aerospace and Electronic Systems</strong></em>, 62 (2026) 5021-5033.<br></p></li>            <li><p>Q. Q. Qiu, B. Zhou*, X. Hu, Disturbance observer and disturbance utilization based attitude tracking control for hypersonic vehicles, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Aerospace and Electronic Systems</strong></em>, 62 (2026) <span style=\"\">, 1721-1733</span>.<br></p></li>            <li><p>H.-Y. Zheng, B. Zhou*, Y. Ding, M.-R. Hao, Prescribed-time chattering-free sliding mode guidance law with terminal angle constraint based on periodic delayed feedback, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Aerospace and Electronic Systems</strong></em>, 61 (2025) <span style=\"\">932-942</span>.</p></li>            <li><p>G.-B. Cai*, T. Wu, M.-R. Hao, T. Liu, B. Zhou, Dynamic event-triggered gain-scheduled <em>H</em><sub>∞</sub> control for a polytopic LPV model of morphing aircraft, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Aerospace and Electronic Systems</strong></em>, 61 (2025) <span style=\"\">93-106</span>.</p></li>            <li><p>K.-K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, H.-Y. Jiang, G.-R. Duan, Finite-time control of a class of nonlinear underactuated systems with application to underactuated axisymmetric spacecraft, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Aerospace and Electronic Systems</strong></em><span style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\">, 59 (2023) 7061-7071.</span></p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, Z.-Y. Li*, W. X. Zheng, B. Zhou, Fully distributed formation flying control of multiple spacecraft by observer based linear output protocols, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Aerospace and Electronic Systems<span style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\"></span></strong><span style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\"></span></em><span style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\">, 59 (2023), 9539-9550.</span><br></p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, H.-Y. Jiang, G. Liu, G.-R. Duan, Practical prescribed-time sampled-data control of linear systems with applications to the air-bearing testbed, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Industrial Electronics</strong></em>, 69 (2022) 6152-6161.</p></li>            <li><p>H.-Y. Jiang, B. Zhou*, G.-R. Duan, Modified λ-policy iteration based adaptive dynamic programming for unknown discrete-time linear systems, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems</strong></em>, 35 (2024) <span style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\">3291-3301</span>.</p></li>            <li><p>H. Y. Zheng, B. Zhou*, Y. Ding, M. R. Hao, Distributed fixed-time command recovery and exact-handover cooperative guidance with impact time and angle constraints, <em style=\"\"><strong>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</strong></em>, DOI: 10.1109/TCYB.2026.3740532.<br></p></li>            <li><p>S.-L. Li, B. Zhou*, Y. Shi, Robust semi-global and global stabilization for nonlinear normal form systems by time-varying feedback, <em style=\"\"><strong>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</strong></em>, 56 (2026) 6262 – 6273.<br></p></li>            <li><p>D. Jiang, F. Zhang, B. Zhou*, H.-Y. Jiang, Prescribed-time output-feedback tracking control of a class of time-varying output-constrained systems, <em style=\"\"><strong>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</strong></em>, 56 (2026) 5010-5023.</p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, G.-R. Duan, Fully distributed and attack-immune protocols for prescribed-time consensus by using periodic delayed relative output, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</strong></em>, 56 (2026) <span style=\"\">1379-1389</span>.<br></p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou*, J.-C. Dong, G.-B. Cai, Normal forms of linear time-varying systems with applications to output feedback stabilization and tracking, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</strong></em>, <span style=\"\">55 </span>(2025), 2671-2683.<br></p></li>            <li><p>S.-L. Li, B. Zhou*, G.-R. Duan, Y. Shi, Prescribed-time semi-global control for a class of nonlinear uncertain systems by linear time-varying feedback, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</strong></em>, 55 (2025) 1172-1182.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou*, Z.-X. Peng, W. Michiels, Memoryless dual-observer based output feedback stabilization of linear systems with delays in the inputs and outputs, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</strong></em>, 54 (2024) 5806-5817.<br></p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou*, K.-K. Zhang, A linear time-varying inequality approach for prescribed time stability and stabilization, <em style=\"\"><strong>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</strong></em>, 53 (2023) 1880-1889.<br></p></li>            <li><p>X.-F. Yang, B. Zhou*, Consensus of discrete-time multiagent systems with input delays by truncated pseudo-predictor feedback, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</strong></em>, 49 (2019) 505-516.</p></li>            <li><p>G. Z. Liu, B. Zhou*, K. Zhang, G.-R. Duan, A survey on consensus security in multi-agent systems, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man and Cybernetics: Systems</strong></em>, DOI: 10.1109/TSMC.2026.3747133.<br></p></li>            <li><p>J. W. Cao, B. Zhou*, Characterizations of functional observability, output controllability and the generalized separation principle with applications, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man and Cybernetics: Systems</strong></em>, DOI: 10.1109/TSMC. 2026.3732473.</p></li>            <li><p>H.-F. Li, B. Zhou*, W. Michiels, Prescribed-time unknown input observers design for singular systems: a periodic delayed output approach, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man and Cybernetics: Systems</strong></em>, 54(2024) 741-751.<br></p></li>            <li><p>H.-F. Li, B. Zhou*, W. Michiels, Prescribed-time unknown input observers design by using periodic delayed output with application to fault estimation, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man and Cybernetics: Systems</strong></em>, 53 (2023) 664-674.</p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, B. Zhou, W. X. Zheng*, G.-R. Duan, Event-triggered and self-triggered gain scheduled control of linear systems with input constraints, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man and Cybernetics: Systems</strong></em>, 52 (2022) 6452-6463.</p></li>            <li><p>K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, G.-R. Duan, Event-triggered and self-triggered control of discrete-time systems with input constraints, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics: Systems</strong></em>, 52 (2022) 1948-1957.</p></li>            <li><p>W.-W. Luo, B. Zhou*, L. He, G.-R. Duan, Global stabilization of the spacecraft rendezvous system by delayed and bounded linear feedback, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man and Cybernetics: Systems</strong></em>, 52 (2022) 1373-1384.</p></li>            <li><p>Q.-S. Liu, B. Zhou*, Consensus of discrete-time multiagent systems with state, input and communication delays, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics: Systems</strong></em>, 50 (2020) 4425-4437.</p></li>            <li><p>R. Q. Zhang, H. Y. Jiang*, B. Zhou, Data-driven bias Lyapunov iteration for optimal control of unknown Markovian jump linear systems, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems I: Regular Papers</strong></em>, 73 (2026) 3667-3679.<br></p></li>            <li><p>J. -M. Liu, Z.-Y. Li*, B. Zhou, Fully distributed output regulation of linear discrete-time multi-agent systems with Markov switching topology, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems I: Regular Papers</strong></em>, 72 (2025) 7272-7280.<br></p></li>            <li><p>H.-Y. Jiang*, X. Li, B. Zhou, X.-B. Cao, Bias-policy iteration based adaptive dynamic programming for optimal control of discrete-time nonlinear systems, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems I: Regular Papers</strong></em>, 72 (2025), 4284-4296.<br></p></li>            <li><p>Z. A. Lodhi, K. Zhang, B. Zhou, H.-Y. Jiang*, Adaptive prescribed-time consensus for a class of nonlinear multi-agent networks by bounded time-varying protocols, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems I: Regular Papers</strong></em>, 71 (2024) <span style=\"\">, 4742-4752.</span></p></li>            <li><p>Z.-Y. Li, Y. Liu, B. Zhou*, Differential flatness of single-input commensurate delay systems with applications to trajectory planning, tracking and transformation to fully actuated systems, <em style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\"><strong>IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems I: Regular Papers</strong></em>, 71 (2024) 3799-3809.<br></p></li>            <li><p>Y.-X. Song, Z.-Y. Li*, B. Zhou, Stability analysis of linear neutral delay systems with two delays via augmented Lyapunov-Krasovskii functionals, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems I: Regular Papers</strong></em>, 70 (2023) 460-471.<br></p></li>            <li><p>K.-K. Zhang, B. Zhou*, G.-R. Duan, Prescribed-time input-to-state stabilization of normal nonlinear systems by bounded time-varying feedback, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems I: Regular Papers</strong></em>, 69 (2022) 3715-3725.</p></li>            <li><p>X.-F. Yang, B. Zhou*, F. Mazenc, Global stabilization of the discrete-time integrators system by bounded controls, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems I: Regular Papers</strong></em>, 67 (2020) 5175-5188.<br></p></li>            <li><p>X.-F. Yang, B. Zhou*, J. Lam, Global stabilization of multiple oscillator systems by delayed and bounded feedback, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems II: Express Briefs</strong></em>, 64 (2017) 675-679.</p></li>            <li><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:3px;margin-left:4px;line-height:21px;text-autospace:none\">B. Zhou*, Eigenstructure assignment of output-nulling friends by Sylvester mapping, <em><strong>IEEE Control Systems Letters</strong></em>, 10 (2026) 2275-2280.</p></li>            <li><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:3px;margin-left:4px;line-height:21px;text-autospace:none\">J. W. Cao, B. Zhou*, Pole assignment with fixed hidden modes in noncoprime scalar linear high-order differential systems, <em style=\"\"><strong>IEEE Control Systems Letters</strong></em>, 10 (2026) 2467-2472.<br></p></li>            <li><p>J. W. Cao, B. Zhou*, W. Michiels, Prescribed-time unknown input observers design for linear systems with commensurate delays, <em style=\"\"><strong>IEEE Control Systems Letters</strong></em>, 10 (2026) 223-228.<br></p></li>            <li><p>S. D. Cao, B. Zhou*, G.-R. Duan, Echelon form criterion for the existence of a regular relative degree, <em><strong>IEEE Control Systems Letters</strong></em>, 10 (2026) 121-126.<br></p></li>            <li><p>Z. X. Peng, B. Zhou, K. Zhang*, Fully distributed and attack-immune consensus by distributed dual observer based linear time-varying output feedback, <em><strong>IEEE Control Systems Letters</strong></em>, 9 (2025)<span style=\"\"> 2615-2620</span>.</p></li>            <li><p>R. -Q. Zhang, H.-Y. Jiang*, B. Zhou, Prescribed-time stabilization of a class of uncertain nonlinear systems by adaptive dynamic programming, <strong><em>IEEE Control Systems Letters</em></strong>, 9 (2025) 2025-2030.<br></p></li>            <li><p>Z.-Y. Li, L. Zhao, B. Zhou*, W. Michiels, On the principal relative degree for linear time-delay systems with applications to tracking, disturbance decoupling and model matching, <em><strong>SIAM Journal of Control and Optimization</strong></em>, 64 (2026) 3000-3023.</p></li>            <li><p>L. Zhao, Z.-Y. Li*, B. Zhou, W. Michiels, On the weak infinite zero structures and relative degrees for linear time-delay systems, <em><strong>SIAM Journal on Matrix Analysis and Applications</strong></em>, 45 (2024) <span style=\"\">1873-1890.</span></p></li>            <br>           </ol>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(248, 174, 122);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">代表性论文</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"3e2a99a5441e4727a9025222f31b02f4\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"8c44c7c16c28447baa0aad3cfe361128\">           <ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal; padding-left:70px;\">            <li><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:3px;margin-left:4px;line-height:21px;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">B. Zhou, Exact prescribed-time stabilization and observer design for a class of MIMO nonlinear systems, </span><em><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></em><em style=\"\"><strong>Automatica</strong></em><span style=\"\"> (</span><strong style=\"\">Regular Paper</strong><span style=\"\">)</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">, 185 (2026) 112810.</span></p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou*, K. Zhang, Stabilization of linear systems with multiple unknown time-varying input delays by linear time-varying feedback, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em> (<strong>Regular Paper</strong>), 174 (2025) 112175.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou, On the relative degree and normal forms of linear systems by output transformation with applications to tracking, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 148 (2023) 110800.<br></p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou, Lyapunov differential equations and inequalities for stability and stabilization of linear time-varying systems, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 131 (2021) 109785.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou, Finite-time stabilization of linear systems by bounded linear time-varying feedback, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 113 (2020) 108760.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou, Finite-time stability analysis and stabilization by bounded linear time-varying feedback, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 121 (2020) 109191</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou, Construction of strict Lyapunov-Krasovskii functionals for time-varying time-delay systems, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em> (<strong>Regular Paper</strong>), 107 (2019) 382–397.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou, On stability and stabilization of the linearized spacecraft attitude control system with bounded inputs, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 105 (2019) 448–452.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou, On strong stability and robust strong stability of linear difference equations with two delays, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 110 (2019) 108610.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou, Improved Razumikhin and Krasovskii approaches for discrete- time time-varying time-delay systems, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em> (<strong>Regular Paper</strong>), 91(2018) 256-269.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou, On asymptotic stability of linear time-varying systems, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 68 (2016) 266-276.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou*, A. Egorov, Razumikhin and Krasovskii stability theorems for time- varying time-delay systems, <em><strong>Automatica</strong></em>, 71 (2016) 281-291.</p></li>            <li><p>B. Zhou*, W. Michiels, J. Chen, Fixed-time stabilization of linear delay systems by smooth periodic delayed feedback, <em><strong>IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control</strong></em> (<strong>Full Paper</strong>), 67 (2022) 557-573.</p></li>           </ol>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tabb3502part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(248, 174, 122);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">Brief Introduction</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"1c13ae5783844bbfb88616412fbaf12c\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"f7026271fc7e406eb630ef2a4c7d86d5\">           <p><br></p>           <p><strong>Bin Zhou</strong> is a professor of the Department of Control Science and Engineering at the Harbin Institute of Technology. His current research interests include constrained control, time-delay systems, time-varying systems, multi-agent systems, nonlinear control, and control applications in astronautic engineering.</p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(248, 174, 122);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">Working Experience &amp; Education</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"977b6ad6589942f893dd4a3d604c2879\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"b833de7056164f0e8ce59ff37b1b879e\">           <p><br></p>           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">            <li><p>2012.12—Now <strong>Professor</strong>, School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin</p></li>            <li><p>2010.12—2012.12 <strong>Associate Professor</strong>, School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin</p></li>            <li><p>2009.02—2010.12 <strong>L</strong><strong>ecturer</strong>, School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin</p></li>            <li><p>2006.03—2010.04 <strong>Ph.D</strong>, Dep. of Control Science and Technology, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, PR China</p></li>            <li><p>2004.09—2006.03 <strong>M.Sc</strong>, Dep. of Control Science and Technology, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, PR China</p></li>            <li><p>2000.09—2004.07 <strong>B.Sc</strong>, Dep. of Control Science and Technology, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin, PR China</p></li>           </ul>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(248, 174, 122);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">Research Interests</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"a01ddc0813704ffcba342ffd20e0d47c\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"6f62a1f675d746819772f62691a29c4f\">           <p><br></p>           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">            <li><p><strong>Spacecraft Control</strong> (rendezvous, formation flying, and attitude control with delays and actuator saturations)</p></li>            <li><p><strong>Time-delay Systems</strong> (delay compensation, predictor feedback, stabilization in the presence of actuator saturation, periodic delayed feedback)</p></li>            <li><p><strong>Constrained and Nonlinear Control</strong> (actuator saturation, feedforward nonlinear systems, energy constraints)</p></li>            <li><p><strong>Multi-agent Systems</strong> (consensus with delay and/or actuator saturation,observer based output feedback)</p></li>            <li><p><strong>Time-varying Systems</strong> (stability, stabilization, periodic linear systems, time delays, <span style=\"\">periodic delayed feedback,</span> applications in aerospace)</p></li>            <li><p><strong>Finite-time control</strong> (finite-time control, fixed-time control, prescribed-time control, time-varying high-gain feedback, periodic delayed feedback)<br></p></li>           </ul>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(248, 174, 122);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">Professional Activities</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><